## AI-Tool Instructions

When generating or modifying code in this repository:

1. **Follow conventions in `.forge/conventions.json`** — run `forge lint` to validate
2. **Write tests before code** — failing tests first, then implementation
3. **Run `forge scan security` before every PR** — fix all findings
4. **Keep `forge clean --check` green** — no unmanifested scratch files
5. **Update `ROLLBACK.md`** when adding new deployment-impacting changes
6. **Respect the migration safety rules** — never `DROP COLUMN` in a forward migration
7. **Consult `.forge/instructions/global.instructions.md`** for domain-specific conventions

## Forge Workflow

```bash
forge ship <feature>          # Full 5-checkpoint pipeline
forge ship --quick <feature>  # Lightweight spec + code only
forge scan security           # OWASP scan before PR
forge lint                    # Convention lint
forge clean --check           # Hygiene check
forge doctor                  # Diagnose setup issues
```
